# 07_genus_40hz.ledc — 40 Hz GENUS (Cognition), 60 min — flagship gamma protocol
# Technique: playbook §C GENUS template (B4). Light + sound BOTH at a fixed 40 Hz,
#            synchronously, in-phase, steady for 60 min, then fade.
#   Visual : white light square wave at 40 Hz, 50% duty (12.5 ms on / 12.5 ms off).
#   Audio  : ~10 kHz tone train GATED at 40 Hz as a short CLICK — GENUS uses a
#            1 ms pulse / 25 ms period = 4% duty (NOT binaural). Expressed via the
#            audio `duty` column = 4 with a square gate envelope (env=0).
#   Combined audio + visual at the SAME 40 Hz = best multimodal outcome.
#   Dose: 1 h/day. Single fixed 40 Hz the whole session (no arc/descent).
#
# EXPERIMENTAL: the 40 Hz amyloid / disease-modifying claim is CONTESTED; the steady-state
#   entrainment itself is well established. Treat this as experiential, not therapy.
#   Engine caveat: this build's AM depth is fixed (~0.1), so the audio "click" is a shallow
#   4%-duty gate (GENUS-shaped, not a full-depth pulse) — the shape is faithful, the depth
#   is gentle-by-design.
#
# SAFETY / CONTRAINDICATIONS:
#   Do NOT use if you have photosensitive epilepsy, a seizure disorder, or a history of
#   photic migraine. Do not use while driving. Experiential, not medical.
#   40 Hz is ABOVE the 15-25 Hz photosensitive danger band (peak 16-20 Hz) -> synchronized
#   full-field visual flicker IS allowed (the GENUS exception). BUT still:
#     - brightness CAPPED at 45% (moderate, well under strobe intensity),
#     - light RAMPED IN over 15 s and RAMPED OUT over 30 s (never abrupt; >=10 s rule),
#     - 50% duty keeps a brightness floor (no full black<->white DC contrast),
#     - neutral WHITE (255,255,255), no saturated-red strobe,
#     - audio capped at vol 60 (~60-65 dB).
#   (A gentler INVISIBLE-FLICKER comfort variant lives in 27_genus_40hz_dim.ledc.)
#
# LED columns  : time(ms) freq duty bright R G B mask
# Audio columns: A time(ms) freq pan vol mod [ch] [freq_r] [wave] [duty] [env]  (env 0 = square gate)

# --- Ramp-in (00:00 -> 00:30): 40 Hz active immediately; light + audio ease up ---
0       40 50 >0  255 255 255 15      # LED 40 Hz flicker, 50% duty, white; brightness ramp-in from 0
A 0     10000 0 >0 40 1 0 0 4 0       # ch1 GENUS click: 10 kHz carrier, 40 Hz gate, 4% duty square; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Beginning the forty hertz gamma protocol. Relax your gaze and let the light and tone carry you."
15000   40 50 45  255 255 255 15      # LED brightness reaches 45% cap (15 s ramp-in, >=10 s rule satisfied)
A 30000 10000 0 60 40 1 0 0 4 0       # ch1 vol settled at 60 (~30 s fade-in); 40 Hz / 4% click held
S 30000 default 65 "Now holding steady at forty hertz, in gamma. Just rest here and let it work."

# --- Hold (00:30 -> 59:30 = 59 min): steady synchronous 40 Hz audio-visual ---
#   Nothing changes — LED holds 40 Hz / 50% / 45% white; audio holds 10 kHz @ 40 Hz / 4% click, vol 60.
#   GENUS efficacy depends on a FIXED 40 Hz: no frequency LFO, no anti-habituation drift.

# --- Ramp-out (59:30 -> 60:00): simultaneous gentle fade of light AND audio to 0 ---
3570000 40 50 >45 255 255 255 15      # LED brightness ramp-out START 45 ...
A 3570000 10000 0 >60 40 1 0 0 4 0    # ch1 volume ramp-out START 60 ... (parallel with light)
S 3570000 default 65 "The session is closing now. The light and tone gently fade. Well done."
3600000 40 50 0  255 255 255 15       # ... LED brightness -> 0 (light off, 30 s ramp, no abrupt stop)
A 3600000 10000 0 0 40 1 0 0 4 0      # ... ch1 volume -> 0 (audio off, simultaneous with light)
